{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/585476-lore-for-the-ritual-to-create-your-own-little-kingdom","id":585476,"title":"Lore for the Ritual to create your own little kingdom?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-09T17:46:27-07:00","id":585476,"title":"Lore for the Ritual to create your own little kingdom?","content":"Recently, I've been reading Grimm's Neverland, and I've been thinking about the type of Lore it would take for one of the Factions to create their own Neverland. <br /> <br /> Mechanics aside, I've got: <br /> <br /> Lore of Paths 5<br /> Lore of Earth 5<br /> Lore of Portals 5<br /> Lore of Light 4<br /> Lore of Celestials 3<br /> Lore of Realms 4. <br /> <br /> This will just produce a blank landscape. Adding plants and animals is a relatively simple matter, and you don't need to add the extra complexity to the ritual.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts on any adjustments I might need to make?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T20:52:38-07:00","id":585589,"title":"","content":"Trust me dude, you dont wanna create a kingdom or pocket reality...Just...ask the Slayers and Charon and he will kill you.... Stick in the world youre in. Leave that shit for the mages","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T22:12:37-07:00","id":585663,"title":"","content":"It's not so much a pocket reality so much as its a place that you can't just find with a map and compass, or just stumble upon, and it doesn't show up on a satellite. A little place out of the way, where you can actually cast the ritual to make Volcanoes, bastions, and towns where you can bring your mortals together to keep them safe. <br /> <br /> I mean, alternaitvely, you could just make an island out in the middle of the ocean, or a network of caves deep beneath the earth, but I was actually thinking of building this place in the Rockies somewhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}